{"4131610": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Minsgon Simulator: Prologue", "steam_appid": 4131610, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This prologue is a limited version that allows you to experience incubation, evolution, creature care, and the basic mechanics of the Minsgon world. For the full experience, add the full version to your wishlist!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Incubate the Mysterious Eggs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every great adventure begins with a single egg.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carefully place your eggs in the incubators.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over time, each one hatches into a Minsgon with its own traits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rare eggs may yield the most precious creatures of all, the treasures of your collection.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131610/extras/3228710eb82ccc234eb286e30945470e.poster.avif?t=1786949389\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131610/extras/3228710eb82ccc234eb286e30945470e.webm?t=1786949389\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131610/extras/3228710eb82ccc234eb286e30945470e.mp4?t=1786949389\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Each Egg Hatches a Minsgon All Its Own</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the shell cracks, only the stars know what will emerge.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every Minsgon that hatches is unique: its species, rarity, and temperament all differ.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some are cute, some are powerful, some are legendary; only time will tell which one appears.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Record every species you discover in your catalogue (Dex) and complete your collection.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131610/extras/f992d26bf849ec508bf513345b840cb5.poster.avif?t=1786949389\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131610/extras/f992d26bf849ec508bf513345b840cb5.webm?t=1786949389\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131610/extras/f992d26bf849ec508bf513345b840cb5.mp4?t=1786949389\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tame the Wild Minsgons With Love</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A newly hatched Minsgon is timid and wild; earning its trust is your task.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gentle them little by little by petting, feeding, and cleaning them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rarer they are, the more coy they become; winning a legendary Minsgon's heart takes patience and care.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your kindness is never wasted: well cared for Minsgons grow happier and sell for far higher prices.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131610/extras/taming?t=1786949389\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Train and Evolve Into Majestic Forms</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Minsgon raised with love is ready to unleash the power within.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place your tamed Minsgons on training stands; over time they gather experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those that grow strong enough evolve into grander, more enchanting forms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evolution raises both their power and their value; rare evolved forms are priceless to collectors.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131610/extras/4369778ebdb9ecdc9ccb5ab6b4929ab6.poster.avif?t=1786949389\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131610/extras/4369778ebdb9ecdc9ccb5ab6b4929ab6.webm?t=1786949389\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build a Magical Exhibit in Your Garden</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dream up an exhibit grand enough to welcome every curious soul in the city.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell entry tickets to visitors and earn a bountiful income from your exhibit area.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131610/extras/bd59964dfb71a1b59fb8a1bca5ffb962.poster.avif?t=1786949389\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131610/extras/bd59964dfb71a1b59fb8a1bca5ffb962.webm?t=1786949389\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131610/extras/bd59964dfb71a1b59fb8a1bca5ffb962.mp4?t=1786949389\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Showcase and Sell Your Minsgons</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise some Minsgons with all your heart, and send others off for a fine profit.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Display the Minsgons you hatch or raise in your garden and your collection.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the sales stand, set your own price on each Minsgon; let the customer who likes it come and buy it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some Minsgons are so special you cannot bear to sell them, so you keep them for yourself.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131610/extras/971e280a0fdc22735da82bcbc8db79f0.poster.avif?t=1786949389\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131610/extras/971e280a0fdc22735da82bcbc8db79f0.webm?t=1786949389\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131610/extras/971e280a0fdc22735da82bcbc8db79f0.mp4?t=1786949389\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Open Your Own Shop and Welcome Your Customers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy standing behind a magical counter of your own.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open your own shop and fill your shelves with colorful products.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customers shop according to their hearts and their purses; some stretch their budget, others just browse the window.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step up to the counter, take the payment, and give the correct change; a satisfied customer will knock on your door again.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131610/extras/45b27d2217b97afb9eac9fe45ae64031.poster.avif?t=1786949389\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131610/extras/45b27d2217b97afb9eac9fe45ae64031.webm?t=1786949389\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131610/extras/45b27d2217b97afb9eac9fe45ae64031.mp4?t=1786949389\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Expand Your Shop and Become a Legend</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A small stall today, a grand empire tomorrow.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start from a small shop and grow step by step.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add new areas, more shelves, and stronger incubators.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your shop the biggest and most respected in the city.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131610/extras/228814ac8ed9c2f725aed8c2f7170512.poster.avif?t=1786949389\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131610/extras/228814ac8ed9c2f725aed8c2f7170512.webm?t=1786949389\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131610/extras/228814ac8ed9c2f725aed8c2f7170512.mp4?t=1786949389\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >More in the Full Version</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This prologue is only the beginning. Here is some of what awaits you in the full adventure:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 150 unique Minsgon species to discover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A skill tree where you grow your magical abilities: telekinesis and much more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Helpers who run your shop and garden for you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A living world full of changing demands and unexpected surprises.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add the full version to your wishlist for the complete adventure!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This prologue is a limited version that allows you to experience incubation, evolution, creature care, and the basic mechanics of the Minsgon world. For the full experience, add the full version to your wishlist!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Incubate the Mysterious Eggs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every great adventure begins with a single egg.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carefully place your eggs in the incubators.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over time, each one hatches into a Minsgon with its own traits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rare eggs may yield the most precious creatures of all, the treasures of your collection.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131610/extras/3228710eb82ccc234eb286e30945470e.poster.avif?t=1786949389\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131610/extras/3228710eb82ccc234eb286e30945470e.webm?t=1786949389\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131610/extras/3228710eb82ccc234eb286e30945470e.mp4?t=1786949389\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Each Egg Hatches a Minsgon All Its Own</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the shell cracks, only the stars know what will emerge.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every Minsgon that hatches is unique: its species, rarity, and temperament all differ.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some are cute, some are powerful, some are legendary; only time will tell which one appears.</p></li><li><