ction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the sales stand, set your own price on each Minsgon; let the customer who likes it come and buy it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some Minsgons are so special you cannot bear to sell them, so you keep them for yourself.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131610/extras/971e280a0fdc22735da82bcbc8db79f0.poster.avif?t=1786949389\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131610/extras/971e280a0fdc22735da82bcbc8db79f0.webm?t=1786949389\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131610/extras/971e280a0fdc22735da82bcbc8db79f0.mp4?t=1786949389\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Open Your Own Shop and Welcome Your Customers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy standing behind a magical counter of your own.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open your own shop and fill your shelves with colorful products.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customers shop according to their hearts and their purses; some stretch their budget, others just browse the window.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step up to the counter, take the payment, and give the correct change; a satisfied customer will knock on your door again.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131610/extras/45b27d2217b97afb9eac9fe45ae64031.poster.avif?t=1786949389\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4131610/extras/45b27d2217b97afb9eac9fe45ae64031.webm?t=1786949